{"id":"701384155759c5f1","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-order9-complete-join-semilattice.md","title":"ZFC Order9 Complete Join Semilattice","display":"df-zfc-order9-complete-join-semilattice — ZFC Order9 Complete Join Semilattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order9-complete-join-semilattice","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order9-complete-join-semilattice"],"display":"df-zfc-order9-complete-join-semilattice — ZFC Order9 Complete Join Semilattice","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order9-complete-join-semilattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order9-complete-join-semilattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order9-complete-join-semilattice — ZFC Order9 Complete Join Semilattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (carrier set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\preccurlyeq\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> (order relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CompleteJoinSemilattice}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CompleteJoinSemilattice}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}complete\\text{-}join\\text{-}semilattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CompleteJoinSemilattice}_S(P,\\preccurlyeq)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\preccurlyeq)\n\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\\exists j\\in P\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,j\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\n\\forall u\\in P\\;\n\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq))\\to\\langle j,u\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}complete\\text{-}join\\text{-}semilattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CompleteJoinSemilattice}_S(P,\\preccurlyeq)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\preccurlyeq)\n\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\\exists j\\in P\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,j\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\n\\forall u\\in P\\;\n\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq))\\to\\langle j,u\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order relation is now an argument, and each arbitrary join is characterized by upper-boundedness and leastness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S$ (partial-order predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-partial-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\preccurlyeq\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CompleteJoinSemilattice}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}complete\\text{-}join\\text{-}semilattice}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9CompleteJoinSemilattice}_S(P,\\preccurlyeq)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcPartialOrder}_S(P,\\preccurlyeq)\n\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq P\\;\\exists j\\in P\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,j\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\qquad\\land\n\\forall u\\in P\\;\n\\bigl((\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq))\\to\\langle j,u\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1329,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2967","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-order9-complete-join-semilattice.md|58-df-zfc-order9-complete-join-semilattice]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9ee45afab4c00dd5"]}